 reasoning_trace="""Name and version intent: "Newsletter Ops v1" — ships weekly without burning the list. Preconditions: confirmed opt-in list; authenticated domain (SPF/DKIM/DMARC); template system. Steps: Step 1 (Editor): editorial calendar — one promise per issue, locked 7 days out; artifact: calendar; verification: every issue has a named takeaway. Step 2 (Writer): draft with the stumble test (read aloud); artifact: draft; verification: one idea per section, scannable. Step 3 (Ops): pre-send checks — links, personalization, suppression, seed test; artifact: checklist signed; verification: test email rendered. Step 4 (Analyst): post-send review — deliverability first, then opens, then clicks (1s-trailhead#5: metrics hierarchy — deliverability is the gate); artifact: send report; verification: report filed within 48h. Approval gates: Tier 1 — each issue approved before send (external audience). Failure modes: deliverability dip (pause growth, audit); complaint spike (suppress segment, investigate source). Attribution note: growth and revenue per send; honest note that content quality is the confound.""",
