 reasoning_trace="""Name and version intent: "Review Response v1" — every review answered, none auto-answered. Preconditions: review monitoring live (Google + key platforms); response templates drafted; escalation path defined. Steps: Step 1 (Monitor): daily review sweep; artifact: new-review queue; verification: queue cleared daily. Step 2 (Drafter): draft responses — 5-star: thanks + specific detail; 4-star: thanks + address the nit; 3-star and below: acknowledge, take offline, no defensiveness; artifact: drafts; verification: every draft in brand voice, no template-stuffing. Step 3 (Approver): human approval per response; artifact: published responses; verification: approval record. Approval gates: Tier 1 — templates approved once; Tier 2 — every individual response approved, forever; 1-2 star responses escalate to owner (never auto-respond). Failure modes: fake review (report, do not engage publicly); review bomb (pause drafts, human triage, document). Attribution note: rating trend and response rate vs. baseline; honest note that service quality is the confound.""",
